            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "OMWAMI yasunjila mbu Orasaayila abandu bano amalayi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olwa baba nibahonga inzala shindalahulila okhuhaaba khwabwe ta; kata olwa baba nibamala emisango emisambe nemisango chieimele, shindalabafuchiilila tawe; ne ndalabasishia nolukanga, neinzala, noluumbe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nisunga mbu E, Omwami NYASAYE! Lola, abanabii babasunjilanga mbu Shimulalola olukanga kata okhubakhwo neinzala ta; ne ndalamuheelesia omulembe kwatoto habundu hano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana OMWAMI niyasunjila mbu Abanabii tsana barumbulilanga obubeeyi muliira lianje; isie shindabaruma ta, kata okhubalaka kata okhusungana ninabo ta. Bamurumbulila libisulo liobubeeyi, nobufumu obukhaya, nobukaatii obwomumioyo chiabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, kano niko aka OMWAMI aboola khukabanabii abarumbulilanga muliira lianje, ne shindabaruma ta; nebutswa baboola mbu Olukanga neinzala shibilabakhwo mushialo shino ta; mbu Olukanga neinzala nibio ebilatibia abanabii abo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abandu aba barumbulilanga balasukunwa mumihanda chieYerusalemu khulwa inzala nende olukanga; kata balabula ababayabila, bo abeene, nabakhasi babwe, nabaana babwe abasiani, nabaana babwe abakhaana. Okhuba ndalatsukha butsukha obubii bwabwe khubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
